{"about_the_game":"The main character is a young man who has come to a foreign country in search of adventure. In bustling Tokyo, he meets Ren, a vulnerable girl who recently broke up with her boyfriend. To help her, he creates a new identity as an American rock star seeking peace and inspiration. Ren believes him and invites him to her home.<br><br>He must decide whether to continue playing the role and enjoying her attention and body or take a risk and reveal who he really is. The deeper he gets into this story, though, the more he realizes that lies have a price and that he will have to pay for them with more than just passion.<br><br>Game features:<br><strong>\u2022 A gripping storyline where passion and deception go hand in hand.<br>\u2022 The atmosphere of modern Japan, with its contrast between the noise of the streets and the silence of private life.<br>\u2022 Characters with depth, weaknesses, and hidden motives.<br>\u2022 Suspense, humor, and explicit scenes.<br>\u2022 Vivid visuals that make every encounter an event. </strong>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4051930?t=1760667031","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4051930/73606bbc52901c8ed49f38ade34bd68b40bea4d1/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1760667031","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4051930/ad3f6d428abac95f0af24ee9baa4ef445187ceea/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1760667031","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4051930/ad3f6d428abac95f0af24ee9baa4ef445187ceea/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1760667031","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[1,3,4,5],"notes":"WARNING!\r\nThis game is for ADULTS only and it includes explicit, sexual content that some viewers may find offensive. The characters shown in the game are all over 18 years old."},"detailed_descript